:271,"locator":"[S15T15]","raw_turn_sha256":"4cd662a8287360452e0fa136e9faa6fc8f7e8017d6ac2c5510de869f42bead4f","rendered_turn_sha256":"b846f6abd94989063ff462adac6e06758c25f0508644bc69369d4f73e919707d","session_date":"2023-08-22","session_datetime":"2023-08-22T11:06:00","session_id":"session_15","session_index":15,"source_sha256":"22c5f44a590f8f6de08898b27f0c1f43e4bcc792b2a5c9b57026a3a086fb8dad","speaker":"Dave","turn_index":15}],"speaker":null,"store_id":"s1","store_snapshot_sha256":"ca39361e8e23f204a9fda55fc83e3ce7f411c7c8d582939aa63688c1923c7679","text":"Dave: Wow, Tokyo sounds like an incredible experience!\n[S15T5] (dia_id: D15:5)\n\nCalvin: It was an incredible experience, Dave! The city was buzzing with energy and the festival crowd was so lively - it was like fuel for my soul. Look at this photo, that's amazing!\n[Image caption: a photo of a crowd of people sitting on the grass at night]\n[S15T6] (dia_id: D15:6)\n\nDave: Wow, that sounds incredible! What was it like playing at the festival? Must have been an amazing experience.\n[S15T7] (dia_id: D15:7)\n\nCalvin: It was a dream come true, Dave! The festival had buzzing energy and a super upbeat crowd. We all felt connected, it was amazing!\n[S15T8] (dia_id: D15:8)\n\nDave: Sounds like you had a blast! Did any other collaborations come out of that performance? Any upcoming concerts we should know about?\n[S15T9] (dia_id: D15:9)\n\nCalvin: Yeah Dave, someone even noticed my performance and now we're working together, which is wild. My tour ends soon and I'm heading to Boston. Maybe we can meet up then!\n[S15T10] (dia_id: D15:10)\n\nDave: Sounds great! Fill me in on the details when you have them and let's meet up when you're here. Can't wait to hear all about everything!\n[S15T11] (dia_id: D15:11)\n\nCalvin: Of course, Dave can't wait to catch up! I almost forgot, yesterday my friends and I recorded a podcast where we discuss the rapidly evolving rap industry!\n[S15T12] (dia_id: D15:12)\n\nDave: That sounds fantastic! I'm looking forward to listening to your podcast and learning more about the rap industry. Keep up the great work!\n[S15T13] (dia_id: D15:13)\n\nCalvin: I'll let you know when the podcast will be uploaded. Take care!\n[S15T14] (dia_id: D15:14)\n\nDave: Sure, Calvin! Looking forward to hearing about it. See ya then!\n[S15T15] (dia_id: D15:15)","text_sha256":"04287e2ed70504fc64cf4cee2f347d691bfb1a8a50761a7b13a98ca9d2896211","timestamp":"2023-08-22T11:06:00"},{"attribution_index_sha256":"08302ae53c7681312a62f5734d6ef73dfd8c86405ba319838bd79230cce094d2","attribution_units":[{"dia_ids":["D21:1"],"kind":"raw_turn","line_end":13,"line_start":12,"source_locators":["[S21T1]"],"text_sha256":"96885ab7be7f52e2e73eeb7f0663c02f406519146de279324dca7fa59c58de8d"},{"dia_ids":["D21:2"],"kind":"raw_turn","line_end":16,"line_start":15,"source_locators":["[S21T2]"],"text_sha256":"e9ac039e6ee239f41520a4e24b35b6e673a5f025f29f085c6fa31d9b78e645b7"},{"dia_ids":["D21:3"],"kind":"raw_turn","line_end":20,"line_start":18,"source_locators":["[S21T3]"],"text_sha256":"d3acb539a7975ee61922df44aefcec73421678a4fd02414445d2a2713f9a2dfe"},{"dia_ids":["D21:4"],"kind":"raw_turn","line_end":23,"line_start":22,"source_locators":["[S21T4]"],"text_sha256":"d94c796a816db5e33e791bea751862e20a15b44f4ea430351490c5837c1fb68d"},{"dia_ids":["D21:5"],"kind":"raw_turn","line_end":26,"line_start":25,"source_locators":["[S21T5]"],"text_sha256":"52da6afe2a9f0cff62231bba0eae15a078d74aa923b880abe272e6f17c7a682b"},{"dia_ids":["D21:6"],"kind":"raw_turn","line_end":30,"line_start":28,"source_locators":["[S21T6]"],"text_sha256":"18ddc1dac20ed924705f00f17e262e027897c7b798eeb9f09beeafdc06753c7c"}],"dia_ids":["D21:1","D21:2","D21:3","D21:4","D21:5","D21:6"],"evidence_id":"ev-3457919cfa24cbaefcfec655c42d2909a94af04d3695bea441651cf5daa73ebe","group_id":"session_21","line_end":30,"line_start":12,"observation_ids":["obs-0001"],"path":"/memories/session-21.md","query_terms":["calvin","dave","boston","meet"],"rank":3,"records_