679","text":"Calvin: Yeah, hard work and dedication are definitely key to reaching our goals and potential. It's awesome to see our growth and progress.\n[S21T13] (dia_id: D21:13)\n\nDave: Yeah, it's great to see our progress. It's really motivating and keeps me pushing for more.\n[S21T14] (dia_id: D21:14)\n\nCalvin: Agreed, Dave! Progress is what keeps us motivated and pushing for more. Let's never give up and keep striving for success. We know that hard work and determination matter, and it's what sets us apart. Onwards to our goals!\n[S21T15] (dia_id: D21:15)\n\nDave: Let's keep going! We won't lose focus on our goals. Hard work and determination will get us there. Let's do this!\n[S21T16] (dia_id: D21:16)\n\nCalvin: Yeah, let's do it! Let's stay focused and work hard to make our dreams happen. We can make it happen together! Wishing you all the best until we meet again!\n\n\n\n\n \n[S21T17] (dia_id: D21:17)\n\nDave: Yep, Calvin! Together, we can do amazing things if we work together and stay motivated. We got this! Take care and stay well!\n[S21T18] (dia_id: D21:18)","text_sha256":"7c1a186c9a791058cc238425ee36ea76804312fde6d409480d93ac85abb58e1a","timestamp":"2023-10-04T14:44:00"}],"integrity":{"post_tree_sha256":"ca39361e8e23f204a9fda55fc83e3ce7f411c7c8d582939aa63688c1923c7679","pre_tree_sha256":"ca39361e8e23f204a9fda55fc83e3ce7f411c7c8d582939aa63688c1923c7679","store_unchanged":true,"verified":true},"metrics":{"completion_tokens":1539,"filesystem_tool_calls":0,"model_calls":4,"orchestration_calls":4,"prompt_tokens":12756,"provider_request_attempts":4,"provider_rounds":4,"token_usage_available":true,"total_tokens":14295},"model":{"requested_model":"coding","served_models":["qwen3.8:27b"]},"prompt_contract":{"derived_prompt_sha256":"6930d93099ac20b76e881b68cbb63b46e1a0a3e2ff43453db685551c3339a6dc","filesystem_tools_sha256":"98017e74a12c2eec4f0139c484d2d6bd809e4f37a8f96c7f419dc9591563dbfa","orchestration_actions_sha256":"3fa6b1160c2f7f9b2a8b3e232721d4ca78a161abb3